<h5>Other Events</h5>
<ul>
<li>A full country-blackout during Tuesday afternoon/evening taught me that this city's footprint is MASSIVE. It would take me 2 hours to walk my morning commute! Uber is a lifesaver when the metro is down, however.</li>
<li>I am slowly adopting Rosita's evening tea and 10pm bedtime routine. I like it more than I care to admit.</li>
<li>Kate and I discovered <em>El Muro</em>, a climbing gym that is only a 10 minute walk from my house. It has tall walls for lead climbing, a bouldering space, and exercise equipment. <em>la raja!</em>
</ul>
